      "title": "krb5: use all_keys to verify PAC server signature to allow U2U",
      "message": "krb5: use all_keys to verify PAC server signature to allow U2U\n\nAs a U2U ticket can't always be distinguished from a normal ticket,\ne.g. in TGS-REP. Revert the old fix which didn't work for that case.\n",
